# playpick cell: mode=clear spec=shaman:restoration style=melee size=25
# difficulty=heroic view=1280x800 save=fresh.
#
# A fresh profile defaults to 10-normal, so #b=marrow&s=25&h=1 unlocks the
# 25-heroic tier the same way every other 25-heroic clear/walk script in this
# ledger does, then backs out to a real RAID -> WALK IN at the door rather
# than the invite's single-fight "visiting" framing (direction.md's
# 2026-09-26 driver-lesson recipe).
#
# Checked sessions.jsonl first (grepped every shaman:restoration line, and
# every mode=clear line, directly rather than by memory): shaman:restoration
# has one prior mode=clear evening (flee, 25-heroic, 820x1180 touch,
# 2026-09-26) but never melee, and no clear/walk evening on any healer spec
# has ever run under melee -- the eighteen prior clear-mode sessions cover
# melee twice (rogue:assassination and shaman:elemental, both dps) and
# healers three times (priest:discipline/flee+good, druid:restoration/mash,
# shaman:restoration/flee), never crossed with each other. melee's own
# steering (scripts/playbot.ts:952) is a flat beeline to the boss with no
# danger-avoidance term at all -- unlike good's away-then-toward blend -- so
# this is the first time a healer has been walked into and held in melee
# range for a whole evening rather than steered around what is on the floor.
#
# Worth watching for: direction.md's "Not yet filed" single-actor-death
# entries (sim.ts:783-788 ending a pull on the tracked body's own death
# rather than the raid's) have already caught this in mode=daily twice and
# in one mode=walk boss room under priest:discipline/good (four wipes on a
# boss the raid had nearly killed each time). A healer held in melee range
# with no defensive positioning at all is the sharpest test yet of whether
# that same outcome-flip repeats across a whole evening's worth of rooms,
# not just one.
open #b=marrow&s=25&h=1
tap back
tap raid
shot raid-setup
tap next
tap class:shaman:restoration
shot class-selected
tap pull
waitscreen fight 15
state
shot start
targets
ui
evening melee 300 10
shot end
state
says
bill
